{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213070","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1421307001:1":{"text":"おい、アンタはここの作業員か？なんで坑道で酒なんか飲んでるんだ？","source_cn":"喂，你是这里的矿工吗？怎么在宝贵的矿洞里喝酒？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2C4351CDD84AF02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421307002:1":{"text":"じゃ、邪魔すんじゃ、ねえっ！飲みてえから飲むんだよ！","source_cn":"别、别打扰我，我要，我要喝酒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6467645A3379B355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421307003:1":{"text":"けっ、何が、坑道だ……鉱石がないんじゃ、ただの――ひっく！","source_cn":"矿洞……什么宝贵的矿洞……都没有矿了，不就是个——嗝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBA72177DBD55BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421307004:1":{"text":"酒だ！もっと酒をくれ！","source_cn":"喝酒，再来喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE853831B9B8E8FDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1421307004":{"text":"酒だ！もっと酒をくれ！","source_cn":"喝酒，再来喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE853831B9B8E8FDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421307005:1":{"text":"いや、岩相を見るに、少なくとも鉄鉱石はまだかなり採れるはずだ。","source_cn":"看矿洞的岩层状况，不太像完全枯竭才对，至少铁矿应该有不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x187D28C60E12FA6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421307007:1":{"text":"何かあったのかもしれない……ひとまず近くの鉱脈を調べてみよう。","source_cn":"我们先调查下周围的矿脉，看看是不是矿洞出了什么问题吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD403C601FB8DC837","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"鉱脈が枯渇したのか？","source_cn":"没有矿脉了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE97A34F03B329F2E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"鉱脈が枯渇したのか？","female":"鉱脈が枯渇したの？","variant_male_record_index":"72614","variant_female_record_index":"72615","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421307006:1":{"text":"確かにドワーフは酒好きが多いが、坑道で酔っ払うなんてあり得ない！","source_cn":"矮人就算好酒，也不会在矿洞这样美好的地方喝醉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16E5E9998704137A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"完全に酔ってるな。","source_cn":"这家伙完全喝醉了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x98911CDB69C1E030","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"完全に酔ってるな。","female":"完全に酔ってるわね。","variant_male_record_index":"72616","variant_female_record_index":"72617","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speake